<title>USA: W.R. Berkley approves 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>W.R. Berkley approves 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.R. Berkley Corp said on Tuesday that its directors had approved a three-for-two common stock split to shareholders of record on August 27.</p>
<p>The company expects to issue the additional shares on September 18, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>W.R. Berkley, a holding company, added that it currently has 19,674,546 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
